WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.128 --> 00:00:01.347
It helps a small hotel

2
00:00:01.348 --> 00:00:03.368
get its returning guests to book direct,

3
00:00:03.448 --> 00:00:04.847
instead of paying a booking site

4
00:00:04.848 --> 00:00:06.447
to meet them again.

5
00:00:06.448 --> 00:00:08.418
If the parts to fix this are cheap,

6
00:00:08.748 --> 00:00:10.128
why doesn't the inn just do it?

7
00:00:10.312 --> 00:00:12.431
A language model drafts the thank you,

8
00:00:12.432 --> 00:00:13.622
the review request,

9
00:00:13.912 --> 00:00:15.500
the note about the trail in the fall.

10
00:00:15.507 --> 00:00:17.277
I think it can be sold from outside.

11
00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.607
But only for what it recovers,

12
00:00:19.787 --> 00:00:21.807
and what it recovers is a number.
